  ('https://careers.northwind-labs.example/', 'https://careers.northwind-labs.example/jobs/1000', 'DevOps Engineer', 'Northwind Labs', 'Remote, US', CURRENT_DATE - 0, now() - interval '0 hours', 'DevOps', 'full-time', '$110,000 - $140,000', 'Northwind Labs runs the build and deploy platform behind a fleet of fictional logistics apps. We are hiring a DevOps Engineer to own the path from merge to production.

You will maintain Terraform modules for three AWS accounts, run our Kubernetes clusters, and keep the CI pipeline under ten minutes as the monorepo grows.

Day to day you will pair with application teams, review infrastructure changes, and write runbooks that the on-call rotation actually uses.

We expect four or more years of hands-on infrastructure work, comfort with Linux internals, and a habit of measuring before optimizing.

