  ('https://careers.northwind-labs.example/', 'https://careers.northwind-labs.example/jobs/1008', 'Site Reliability Engineer', 'Northwind Labs', 'Toronto, ON', CURRENT_DATE - 8, now() - interval '8 hours', 'SRE', 'full-time', NULL, 'Bluefjord Systems operates a fictional payments network with strict uptime targets. The Site Reliability Engineer joins a team of six that owns SLOs for every customer-facing service.

