Most of our tooling is written in Go. You will contribute to the deploy controller and the capacity planner.

We look for someone who has carried a pager, debugged a production outage end to end, and can explain trade-offs in writing.

Remote worldwide with a four-hour overlap with Central European Time.', ARRAY['kubernetes', 'prometheus', 'go']::text[], 'hybrid', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
