  ('https://careers.northwind-labs.example/', 'https://careers.northwind-labs.example/jobs/1016', 'Machine Learning Engineer', 'Northwind Labs', 'Remote, worldwide', CURRENT_DATE - 16, now() - interval '16 hours', 'AI/ML', 'full-time', NULL, 'Marrowlight AI builds an imaginary document-understanding product. As a Machine Learning Engineer you will train and ship models that read invoices and contracts.

